rumc-job-name-bear-commander = BEAR Squad Leader
rumc-job-callsign-bear-commander = CHTORM Squad Leader
rumc-ghostrole-description-bear-commander = The squad leader of the BEAR PMC. Responsible for mission execution, team coordination, and on-ground decision-making. Carries secret communication with the UPP. First in battle, last to retreat.

rumc-job-name-bear-grenadier = BEAR Grenadier
rumc-job-callsign-bear-grenadier = CHTORM Grenadier
rumc-ghostrole-description-bear-grenadier = Fortification assault specialist. Armed with the RPG-32 with thermobaric rounds. Destroys cover, vehicles, and infantry groups. Operates under the cover of the machine gunner.

rumc-job-name-bear-machinegunner = BEAR Machine Gunner
rumc-job-callsign-bear-machinegunner = CHTORM Machine Gunner
rumc-ghostrole-description-bear-machinegunner = Fire support operator of the BEAR PMC. Armed with the PKP-MS machine gun with a 150-round box magazine. Tasked with suppressing enemy fire points and holding positions. Works in tandem with the grenadier.

rumc-job-name-bear-medic = BEAR Medic
rumc-job-callsign-bear-medic = CHTORM Medic
rumc-ghostrole-description-bear-medic = The primary combat unit of the BEAR PMC. Armed with the AK-13 assault carbine. A versatile fighter for any mission — from reconnaissance to assault. Fast, accurate, reliable.

rumc-job-name-bear-rifleman = BEAR Rifleman
rumc-job-callsign-bear-rifleman = CHTORM Rifleman
rumc-ghostrole-description-bear-rifleman = The primary combat unit of the BEAR PMC. Armed with the AK-13 assault carbine. A versatile fighter for any mission — from reconnaissance to assault. Fast, accurate, reliable.

